\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Functional flow diagram of the level loop, one inlet shown [COO Fig.~7.8]. SMs 1--4, 9 and 10 run once per inlet; SMs 5--8 once for the pen. Solid: data flow; dashed: feedback from the pump. Level*Pen stands for LevelInsidePen and LevelOutsidePen. A pair with a lost transmitter drops out at SM~3; with no valid pair, SM~8 runs LIC01 at SafeOutput. Execution order in Figure~\ref {fig:exec}.}}{10}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:ffd}{{5}{10}{Functional flow diagram of the level loop, one inlet shown [COO Fig.~7.8]. SMs 1--4, 9 and 10 run once per inlet; SMs 5--8 once for the pen. Solid: data flow; dashed: feedback from the pump. Level*Pen stands for LevelInsidePen and LevelOutsidePen. A pair with a lost transmitter drops out at SM~3; with no valid pair, SM~8 runs LIC01 at SafeOutput. Execution order in Figure~\ref {fig:exec}}{figure.5}{}}
